# The repo root .gitignore ignores *.json for data artifacts. These are not
# artifacts of a run: they are hand-written test cases shared by the Python and
# R suites (arrival_gates_cases.json pins F12's earliest-arrival and carryover
# rule for tests/test_arrival_gates.py and lane A's R port;
# memo_redisclosure_cases.json pins F13's memo re-disclosure rule for
# tests/test_memo_redisclosure.py and tests/test_memo_redisclosure.R). Without this
# negation `git add mentat/tests/fixtures` adds nothing.
!*.json
